      "side": 1,
      "message": "The standards aren\u0027t entirely clear, as there are optional fields for specific activity[1] that one could have report specific measurement data (response time).\n\nThe CADF document[0] doesn\u0027t mention request_id or global_id specifically, but they could be considered attributes of an event IMO.\n\nHaving this in the basic notifications could also be an option if this isn\u0027t strictly CADF.\n\n[0] https://www.dmtf.org/sites/default/files/standards/documents/DSP0262_1.0.0.pdf#page\u003d23\n\n[1] https://www.dmtf.org/sites/default/files/standards/documents/DSP0262_1.0.0.pdf#page\u003d32",
